    "detailed_description": "<strong>The Multiverse Trilogy</strong> is a fast-paced, FPS, prequel to Alternate Universe that takes heavy inspiration from Ultrakill.<br><br><strong>THEY LIED TO US</strong><br><br>Your journey begins with you picking up a single weapon, but as you progress through and the enemies are becoming stronger, your arsenal grows. Use your weapons to kill the enemies and save your universe from danger.<br><br><strong>WE WERE LED INTO A TRAP</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You, employee, and the team must protect your universe from upcoming enemies before it\u2019s too late.<br></li><li>Use your many weapons in your arsenal to stay alive and avoid the relentless attacks of your enemies.<br></li><li>If you ever low on health, there are heal pods scattered through your surrounding areas. Use them wisely.</li></ul><br><strong>THEY GAVE US NON-FUNCTIONAL WEAPONS AND LEFT US TO DIE</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>I SHOULD HAVE DECIDED TO (NOT ALIVE) RIGHT THEN AND THERE</i><br></li><li><i>BECAUSE THIS IS SO MUCH WORSE</i></li></ul>",
